## Layer rules (onion)

1. **Domain** (`src/domain/`) — innermost layer. Entities, value objects,
   repository interfaces (ports), domain services. Zero framework imports.
   Pure Python only.
2. **Application** (`src/application/`) — use cases and DTOs. Orchestrates
   domain entities via interfaces. No framework imports.
3. **Infrastructure** (`src/infrastructure/`) — outermost layer. Persistence
   adapters, web routers, external integrations. Depends on domain and
   application.

